name: ['Azusa, Lost but Seeking', 'Brion Stoutarm', 'Glissa, the Traitor', 'Godo, Bandit Warlord', 'Grimgrin, Corpse-Born', 'Karn, Silver Golem', 'Karrthus, Tyrant of Jund', 'Mayael the Anima', 'Sliver Queen', 'Zur the Enchanter']
